        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There indeed seem to be only three mappings. I don't think it is worth adding to 'mini.clue' directly, as they are quite rarely used. While adding them to 'mini.clue' suggested triggers and clues won't make them more discoverable. And if they are used frequently, then I hope it should be easy enough to remember them.",
